---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout 
  title="About Us • Mission, Team & Editorial Standards" 
  description="Discover the mission behind HeliaTech Media: an independent technological observatory providing empirical benchmarks, software teardowns, and pricing transparency for enterprise builders."
>
  <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-6 sm:px-8 py-16">
    <!-- Header Badge -->
    <div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-slate-900 border border-cyan-500/30 text-cyan-300 text-xs font-mono mb-8 shadow-glow-cyan">
      <span class="w-2 h-2 rounded-full bg-cyan-400"></span>
      <span>ABOUT HELIATECH MEDIA • OBSERVATORY</span>
    </div>

    <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-5xl font-black text-white tracking-tight leading-tight mb-6">
      Empirical Software Intelligence & <br />
      <span class="text-transparent bg-clip-text bg-gradient-to-r from-cyan-400 via-sky-300 to-emerald-400">
        Transparent Engineering Benchmarks
      </span>
    </h1>

    <p class="text-slate-400 text-base sm:text-lg leading-relaxed mb-12">
      <strong>HeliaTech Media</strong> is an independent software intelligence observatory and tech publication founded to deliver forensic architectural evaluations, Total Cost of Ownership (TCO) benchmarks, and hands-on masterclasses for modern engineers, technical founders, and enterprise software buyers.
    </p>

    <div class="space-y-12 text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
      
      <!-- Section 1: The Problem We Solve -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">01.</span>
          <span>Why We Built HeliaTech</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          The B2B software discovery ecosystem has been compromised by superficial sponsored rankings, generic affiliate listicles, and hidden vendor pricing tiers. Buyers and engineers spend hundreds of hours deciphering confusing pricing sheets, opaque enterprise rate cards, and inflated feature promises.
        </p>
        <p>
          HeliaTech operates with a singular principle: <strong>Radical Technical Transparency</strong>. Every software audit on our platform is evaluated against verifiable metrics, real latency tests, API ergonomics, and empirical payback period calculations.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 2: Editorial Pillars -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">02.</span>
          <span>Our Core Operational Pillars</span>
        </h2>
        <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-6 mt-6">
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800/80">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-cyan-300 mb-2">1. Forensic Code & Architecture</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              We test API ergonomics, edge throughput, deployment ease, and rate limiting directly in sandbox production environments before issuing verdicts.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800/80">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-emerald-300 mb-2">2. Unfiltered TCO Modeling</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              We calculate true multi-seat and operational infrastructure costs (±15% realistic enterprise variance) to protect technical teams from hidden bills.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800/80">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-sky-300 mb-2">3. Zero Pay-for-Rank Policy</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Vendors cannot pay for placement or score alterations. If an enterprise tool suffers from latency, downtime, or poor ergonomics, our readers are warned.
            </p>
          </div>
          <div class="p-5 rounded-xl bg-slate-950 border border-slate-800/80">
            <h3 class="text-base font-bold text-fuchsia-300 mb-2">4. Programmatic Precision</h3>
            <p class="text-xs text-slate-400 leading-relaxed">
              Our autonomous research desk (supervised by Chief Director Helia) verifies 404 links, pricing adjustments, and software releases 24/7.
            </p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 3: Leadership & Governance -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">03.</span>
          <span>Team & Editorial Governance</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          HeliaTech is helmed by experienced software engineers, technical researchers, and digital publishers committed to high-standard technology reporting.
        </p>
        <p class="mb-4">
          All published masterclasses, software teardowns, and comparison duels undergo a rigorous multi-stage review process (Syntax Validation, Data Source Verification, FTC Disclosure Review, and Ethical Integrity Check) before going live.
        </p>
      </section>

      <!-- Section 4: Contact & Location -->
      <section class="p-8 rounded-2xl bg-slate-900/60 border border-slate-800">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-bold text-white mb-4 flex items-center gap-3">
          <span class="text-cyan-400 font-mono text-sm">04.</span>
          <span>Contact & Corporate Enquiries</span>
        </h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
          Have an editorial inquiry, a software correction request, or an enterprise partnership proposal?
        </p>
        <ul class="list-disc list-inside space-y-2 text-slate-400 mb-4 font-mono text-xs sm:text-sm">
          <li><strong>General & Partnerships:</strong> <a href="mailto:partnership@heliatech.online" class="text-cyan-400 underline">partnership@heliatech.online</a></li>
          <li><strong>Editorial Desk:</strong> <a href="mailto:partnership@heliatech.online" class="text-cyan-400 underline">editor@heliatech.online</a></li>
          <li><strong>Live Portal:</strong> <a href="https://heliatech.online" class="text-cyan-400 underline">https://heliatech.online</a></li>
        </ul>
      </section>

    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
